It was indeed Asami who had helped me the most during this\nwhole business, but...%K%P
这次的事，直接支撑着我的，\n确实是麻实…%K%P
...there was another person who acted behind the scenes,\ntaking care of our food, laundry, and overall well-being.%K%P
但是在那背后，负责我饮食、帮我办妥住院手续、\n虽然不显眼，但默默照顾我的是…%K%P
Dinner with a show might not exactly be something that was\nToko's style. In fact, she might laugh the very idea off,\nbut...%K%P
享受晚餐这种事，可能并不适合都子。\n『这什么啊这』，她也许会这样一笑了之。%K%P
...I still wanted her to experience it.%K%P
即便如此…我也想要邀请都子。%K%P
After all, ever since I'd become her guardian, I swore to\nmake her the most important person in my life, regardless\nof the circumstances.%K%P
因为，自从发誓成为监护人与被监护人的那天开始，\n我就已经做好了觉悟，不管怎么选择，都会把都子放在最优先考虑。%K%P
